  <para style="h">Udiana Ñwed Yọọn</para>
  <para style="toc1">Udiana Ñwed Yọọn</para>
  <para style="toc2">Udiana Ñwed Yọọn</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Yọọn</para>
  <para style="mt1">Udiana Ñwed Yọọn</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ekọọm</para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Ami ñkpisọñ Yọọn,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="2JN 1:1">Nnọ ñwed ami esọk asaña-asaña awonwaan a-Abasi amekke ye nditọ amọ a-ami nnekkeke mma ke ntak ammọ ediọọñọke akpanikọ. Idooho ami ikpọọñ mma ammọ ado afịd awo e-ediọọñọke akpanikọ, <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />ke ntak akpanikọ, a-adʌññọ ke ñnyịn, a-adiinyʌñ iba ye ñnyịn ke nsi-nsi. <verse eid="2JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Mfọn, mbọm ye emem a-atooho Abasi Ete ye ke Yisọs Krais, Ayịn Abasi, ayaaba ye ñnyịn ke akpanikọ ye ima.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />Mmekop inemesịd eti-eti adikịt usʌk nditọ mfo naña esaña ke akpanikọ ukem-ukem naña Ete akinọọ ñnyịn ewʌhọ. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Ndin idahami, adima awonwaan, ami ñwette ufa mbed unọ ado kpa mbed a-ñnyịn imaikinenie tọọñọ ke editọọñọ. Mbeeñe yak ñnyịn ima emọ-emọ. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Ima ado ado ami: yak ñnyịn isaña ke ñkobitem ye ewʌhọ amọ. Ndin kpa naña ekop tọọñọ ke editọọñọ, ewʌhọ amọ ado yak ndufo esaña ke ima.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Ntañ ntoro sia uwak mbon abiaña, i-imiinyịmmeke ibo ke Yisọs Krais amaadi ke ederimbod ke abʌkidem, ewuọñọ edọñọ ke ederimbod. Utọ awo ado ado awo abiaña ye andibiọọñọ Krais. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Ikpeme mbaak ididuọọk se ndufo ekekpa utom enọọ, ado nọ ebọ utịb ayọhọ-ayọhọ. <verse eid="2JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Awo akeedodo a-afegheke akpọñ ukpeebñkpọ Krais inieghe Abasi; awo a-akaaha iso ke ukpeebñkpọ Krais anie Ete anyʌñ anie Ayịn. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Adieke awo ndomokeed adiighe ibịne ndufo ado isañake ye ukpeebñkpọ ami, ikiidat anye idʌk ufọk ndufo, ikiinyʌñ idaara anye. <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />Awo ndomokeed a-adaarake anye a-akeene awana ke utom ibak amọ.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />Ami mmenie uwak-uwak ñkpọ se ñkpewet unọọ fiin; ado ñyemme adidat ñwed ye mmọọññwed ñwet. Utu ke ado, ami mmeduak adisọp nduse fiin ñnyʌñ nnie nneme iso ye iso ye afo, nọ ato do idaara ñnyịn ayọhọ.<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Nditọ ayịneka mfo awonwaan ke Krais, A-Abasi akemekke, e-edọñ ekọọm.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>